---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/retail.css';
---
<Base title="Paintless Dent &amp; Door Ding Repair \u2014 Airborne Dent Repair" description="Paintless dent, door ding and crease repair in Gunter, Texas. No filler, no paint, factory finish retained. Free estimate and a lifetime warranty." nav="Services" css="retail">
<main>
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Paintless Dent &amp; Door Ding Repair</p>
    <h1 class="display h-xl rv rv-d1">Take The Dent.<br>Leave The Paint.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv rv-d2">Door dings, creases and dents repaired without filler, sanding or paint — in Gunter, Texas. Free estimate, and a lifetime warranty on every paintless repair we perform.</p>
    <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Get a free estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-facts rv rv-d3">
      <li>Free estimates</li><li>Veteran owned</li><li>Gunter, TX &middot; serving DFW</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-figure" style="--hero:url('/img/card-dent-ding.jpg')">
    <span class="slot-tag hero-slot-tag">Customer vehicle &middot; Airborne Dent Repair</span>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
<section>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">In Plain Terms</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:20ch">A Door Ding Costs More Than It Looks.</h2>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">It is the first thing an appraiser writes down and the first thing a buyer's hand finds on the walk-around. It is also the cheapest damage on a car to put right — as long as the paint over it is still intact.</p>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">Paintless repair reaches behind the panel and works the metal back out. No filler, no sanding, no booth time and no color match that is close but not quite. The panel keeps its original finish, which is the whole point.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">The Short Version</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Estimate</dt><dd>Free</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Warranty</dt><dd>Lifetime on all paintless work</dd></div>
        <div><dt>What it keeps</dt><dd>The finish the factory sprayed on</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Gunter &middot; DFW &amp; North Texas</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="border-top:1px solid var(--hair)">
  <div class="wrap sec-head">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Proof</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">The Damage Was Real.</h2>
    <p class="prose rv rv-d2">This slot is deliberately empty. Every photograph on this site is a job this shop actually did, and we do not have this one yet.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ba-feature ba-half rv rv-d1">
      <div class="ba slot" style="aspect-ratio:1200/769;align-items:flex-end">
        <span class="slot-tag">Photo needed &mdash; door ding before &amp; after pair</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap detail">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Detail</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 0;max-width:18ch">What It Fixes, And What It Doesn't.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="detail-list rv rv-d1">
      <li>
        <strong>Door dings and lot damage</strong>
        <span>The shopping-cart hit, the car parked too close, the curbside knock. Routine work and the fastest to turn around.</span>
        
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Creases</strong>
        <span>A crease is a dent with a fold in it. They take longer, and they are the repair where technique actually shows.</span>
        
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Transport and dolly damage</strong>
        <span>Common on vehicles that have been moved on a truck or shuffled around a lot.</span>
        
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Aluminum panels</strong>
        <span>Aluminum moves differently under the tool than steel does, and it is on a lot of newer trucks and German metal.</span>
        <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: aluminum panel capability</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Where the paint is broken</strong>
        <span>If the finish is cracked through to primer or bare metal, paintless is not the answer, and you will hear that at the estimate.</span>
        <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: conventional repair &mdash; in-house or referral</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">How It Goes</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">Four Steps.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="steps">
  <div class="step rv rv-d0">
    <p class="n">01</p>
    <h3>Free estimate</h3>
    <p>Call, or bring it by. Every estimate is free.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d1">
    <p class="n">02</p>
    <h3>The honest answer</h3>
    <p>Including when paintless is not the right repair for that panel.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d2">
    <p class="n">03</p>
    <h3>The repair</h3>
    <p>Master ARC certified, and deliberately low volume — your car is not one of forty on the floor.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d3">
    <p class="n">04</p>
    <h3>Back to you</h3>
    <p>Lifetime warranty, for as long as that panel is on the vehicle.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="gallery">
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d0"><span class="shot" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-amg-g63-front.jpg')"></span><figcaption>AMG G 63</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d1"><span class="shot" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-rolls-royce-dawn.jpg')"></span><figcaption>Rolls-Royce Dawn</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d2"><span class="shot" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-ram-trx.jpg')"></span><figcaption>Ram TRX</figcaption></figure>
</div>
<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Also In The Bay</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">The Other Three.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="others">
  <a class="other rv" href="/hail-damage-repair">
    <h3>Hail Damage Repair</h3>
    <p>Whole-storm damage or a single dented panel, repaired without touching the factory paint.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/windshield-replacement">
    <h3>Windshield &amp; Glass</h3>
    <p>Replacement at your home or workplace, or in the shop. Your call.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/window-tint">
    <h3>XPEL Window Tint</h3>
    <p>XPEL film exclusively, carrying the manufacturer's warranty.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
</div>
<a class="cross" href="/wholesale">
  <p class="eyebrow">Dealer, body shop or fleet?</p>
  <h2 class="display h-sm">Wholesale &amp; Fleet Accounts</h2>
  <p>Pickup and delivery, up to 25 vehicles a week, and the same lifetime warranty on every
    paintless repair we perform.</p>
  <span class="go">See wholesale <span>&rarr;</span></span>
</a>
<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap final-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Gunter, Texas &middot; Serving DFW &amp; North Texas</p>
      <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:16ch">Get A Free Estimate.</h2>
      <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Request an estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-block rv rv-d1">
      <strong>Airborne Dent Repair</strong>
      <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a>
      <span>Fax 833-907-5267</span>
      <span style="margin-top:.6rem">Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM &middot; Closed Sunday</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
